WEBVTT

00:00:02.000 --> 00:00:06.842
Tenin Coulibaly lo ye. Saan 1915 ka murutiliko kofɔra cogo nɔgɔman na

00:00:10.000 --> 00:00:15.802
Saan 1915. Ka fara o kan, Mohoun kulu gɛrɛfɛ dugu dɔ lo be yen.

00:00:18.000 --> 00:00:20.400
Tenin n'a cɛɛ b'a fɛ ka deen sɔrɔ.

00:00:30.000 --> 00:00:35.146
Nka, o jamana tun be yen. Kɔlɔsilikɛbagaw kuntigi nana dugu kɔnɔ.

00:00:38.000 --> 00:00:41.499
Ne ka kan ni kilomɛtɛrɛ kelen ye ani mɔgɔ dɔw ye sira kan.

00:00:41.499 --> 00:00:43.400
An ka boonw fanin lo pewu.

00:00:43.500 --> 00:00:46.508
O tɛ ɲiningali ye, o ye cikan lo ye.

00:00:49.000 --> 00:00:51.880
Dugu kɔrɔsibagaw tagara ni cɛ saba ye.

00:01:10.000 --> 00:01:13.400
K'an to sirada la, u b'an waajibiya ka baara kɛ.

00:01:13.500 --> 00:01:16.502
Aw ye teliya ka taga! Aw ye jija!

00:01:18.000 --> 00:01:20.000
Cɛɛ dɔ tun be sumaya la.

00:01:27.000 --> 00:01:30.210
Wili ka lɔ. An ka taga baara la!

00:01:33.000 --> 00:01:38.082
An mako b'a la ka tɛmɛ o kan. Kɔlɔsilikɛbagaw kɔsegira dugu kɔnɔ.

00:01:45.000 --> 00:01:48.504
O wagati la, u y'a fɔ Tenin ye ko a kɔnɔman lo.

00:01:53.800 --> 00:01:55.320
A b'an ka den ta!

00:01:57.000 --> 00:01:59.224
An bena taga n'a ye o cogo kelen na.

00:02:04.000 --> 00:02:10.032
Mɔgɔw b'a bon ni kabakuruw ye k'a la dugu ma, fɔ ka na a ben.

00:02:13.600 --> 00:02:14.928
I k'a to yen!

00:02:16.000 --> 00:02:20.570
Cɛ dɔ b'a fɛ k'a dɛmɛ. Kɔlɔsilikɛbaga b'a bali k'o kɛ.

00:02:25.000 --> 00:02:29.608
O su fɛ, dugumɔgɔw bɛɛ nana ɲɔgɔn lajɛn tasuma kɔrɔ.

00:02:35.500 --> 00:02:38.518
O ka ɲi! An tɛna foyi di.

00:02:41.000 --> 00:02:48.114
Cɛkɔrɔba b'a fɛ k'o kɛ. O ka buruw fiyɛ, ka ciraden dɔw ci ka taga dugumɔgɔw fɛ.

00:03:05.000 --> 00:03:09.090
Saan 1915 novanburu. Bani Volta kɛlɛ daminɛna.

00:03:12.000 --> 00:03:18.682
Mɔgɔ murutininw be tagara baara la. Miiri k'a filɛ, biɲɛw be se ka marifaw jaabi.

00:03:27.000 --> 00:03:34.722
Kɛrɛkɛcɛ min bɛ nɛgɛtigɛbana kɛ, ale ka o doni ta; a kɔrɔsibagaw borira.

00:03:37.000 --> 00:03:38.872
Tenin bɔra kaso la.

00:03:50.000 --> 00:03:58.218
Kɔfɛ, u ye murutili kɛ dugu ni dugu. O wagati la, a tun ye mɔgɔbaba dɔ ye Afiriki tileben fan fɛ.

00:04:05.000 --> 00:04:12.322
Nka saan 1916 la, sɔrɔdasiw y'u ka murutili nagasi. Dugumɔgɔw b'u ka jagwɛlɛya sara kosɔbɛ.

00:04:24.500 --> 00:04:27.476
Muso dɔ, denmisɛn dɔ, dugumɔgɔw minw b'a fɔ ko u tɛ sɔn.

00:04:27.500 --> 00:04:29.884
O kama, an hakili b'a la.
